      "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 1200 opened 2017 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 586.6m (2016 comparative). During 2017 the syndicate recorded an overall adverse prior-year development of GBP 53.7m driven principally by the exceptionally severe catastrophe activity in 2017 (Hurricanes Harvey, Irma and Maria, California wildfires and Mexico earthquakes) and adverse development in short-tail classes (notably US Direct & Facultative, Cargo, Yachts & Hull) where rate pressure and unsustainable loss emergence required strengthening of reserves.",
